# The browser-first application needs no runtime environment variables or Python.
# Enter a personal OpenAI API key in the app's AI settings; it stays in tab memory.
# Never put credentials in PUBLIC_ variables or a static deployment artifact.
#
# Build a GitHub project site with:
#   BASE_PATH=/Diesel pnpm build
# BASE_PATH controls build-time route and asset URLs. It is not a secret.
# Legacy Node settings are preserved in docs/archive/ENV_NODE_BASELINE.example.
